  "title": "AV Appoints Aerospace and Defense Executive Michael D. Ruppert to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "ARLINGTON, Va.– Aug. 7, 2026 — AeroVironment, Inc. (“AV”) (NASDAQ: AVAV) today announced that it has appointed Michael D. Ruppert to its Board of Directors, effective August 5, 2026. Mr. Ruppert brings more than 25 years of financial, strategic and corporate development experience in the aerospace and defense sector to AV. He has served as EVP and Chief Financial […]",
